Here is the formula for the enchanting of armor:

Your chance for suceding is dependant totally on the current bonus.
If the current bonus is three or less (five for mithril coats) you will 
always succeed. Otherwise you have a chance out of whatever the current 
bonus is. I.E.- +4 would be 1 in four or 25% chance of succeeding, 
+8 would be 1 in 8 or 12.5% chance.

The formula for enchanting weapons is much simplier and gives you better 
chances:

If it is +5 or less you are almost sure for the enchantment, after that 
you have a 2/3 or 66.66666% chance of succeeding.

